{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/3482","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/3482/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/3482/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/3482/events","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/3482","id":557027808,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU1NTcwMjc4MDg=","number":3482,"title":"[docdb] Iterate over intents after last regular record","user":{"login":"jaki","id":16715704,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzE1NzA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16715704?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki","html_url":"https://github.com/jaki","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":711841622,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MTE4NDE2MjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/kind/bug","name":"kind/bug","color":"c2e0c6","default":false,"description":"This issue is a bug"},{"id":1280238232,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMjgwMjM4MjMy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/area/ysql","name":"area/ysql","color":"0c4fcc","default":false,"description":"Yugabyte SQL (YSQL)"},{"id":1290759928,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMjkwNzU5OTI4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/area/docdb","name":"area/docdb","color":"0c4fcc","default":false,"description":"YugabyteDB core features"},{"id":1353907004,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzUzOTA3MDA0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/priority/high","name":"priority/high","color":"ffdc5e","default":false,"description":"High Priority"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":{"login":"jaki","id":16715704,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzE1NzA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16715704?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki","html_url":"https://github.com/jaki","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"jaki","id":16715704,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzE1NzA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16715704?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki","html_url":"https://github.com/jaki","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2020-01-29T18:05:06Z","updated_at":"2020-02-07T20:17:14Z","closed_at":"2020-02-07T20:17:14Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"EDIT: This issue was previously thought to have been a colocation-only issue.  Now, it seems to be a broader one.  The example in this first post uses a colocated database in YSQL.\r\n\r\nAfter setting up a table as follows,\r\n\r\n```sql\r\nCREATE TABLE r (i int, PRIMARY KEY (i ASC));\r\nINSERT INTO r VALUES (1), (11), (111);\r\n```\r\n\r\nI get this, as expected\r\n\r\n```sql\r\nBEGIN;\r\nINSERT INTO r VALUES (2);\r\nSELECT * FROM r;\r\nROLLBACK;\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\n  i\r\n-----\r\n   1\r\n   2\r\n  11\r\n 111\r\n(4 rows)\r\n```\r\n\r\nbut I get this, which is not expected\r\n\r\n```sql\r\nBEGIN;\r\nINSERT INTO r VALUES (222);\r\nSELECT * FROM r;\r\nROLLBACK;\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\n  i\r\n-----\r\n   1\r\n  11\r\n 111\r\n(3 rows)\r\n```\r\n\r\nand this, which is not expected to succeed\r\n\r\n```sql\r\nINSERT INTO r VALUES (333), (333);\r\nSELECT * FROM r;\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\n  i\r\n-----\r\n   1\r\n  11\r\n 111\r\n 333\r\n(4 rows)\r\n```\r\n\r\nAll of this seems tied to something wrong with the iterator on intents.  I have observed that the intents iterator (`IntentAwareIterator::intent_iter_`, a `BoundedRocksDbIterator`) does not find any intents past the last regular record.  That is why an intent with key `2` is found but an intent with key `222` is not.  `IntentAwareIterator::SeekForwardToSuitableIntent`, when passed the `intent_key_prefix` with key `111` and suffix `0xFF` does not manage to find key `222` during `ROCKSDB_SEEK(&intent_iter_, intent_key_prefix.AsSlice());`.  Rather, `intent_iter_.Valid()` is false after the seek.  If I instead do `intent_iter_.SeekToLast()`, I get an error.\r\n\r\nI have observed the writes to RocksDB (as with the flag `docdb_log_write_batches`), and I found that the intent with key `222` really does get written and not deleted by the time of the `SELECT`.  I have also verified that the `BoundedRocksDbIterator::key_bounds_` for `intent_iter_` has no bounds, so I'm afraid that the issue might go as deep as the internal iterator implementation of RocksDB.\r\n\r\nBut it's hard to believe that that is the case as this is no issue for non-colocated tables.  The only difference should be that records for colocated tables have an ID prefix on the keys, so this suggests that something is wrong with our DocDB logic rather than RocksDB.\r\n\r\nNote that if the transactions are committed, the intents get written to regular DB and are then visible through `SELECT`s.","closed_by":{"login":"jaki","id":16715704,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzE1NzA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16715704?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki","html_url":"https://github.com/jaki","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaki/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/3482/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/3482/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}